        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 7312KA2, Double Cylinder Grade 2 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by DoralLock, the 7312KA2 double cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security lock. The double cylinder function means that there is a  keyed lock on both the exterior and the interior. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\".  It installs easily in most pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted on both the inside and the outside by a key. Since it is keyed on both sides of the door, it is typically used on entry doors with glass near the lock to prevent thieves from breaking the glass and unlocking the deadbolt using a thumbturn.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching  \r\n<a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-grade-2-deadbolt-dor-7301ka2\"><b>DoralLock 7301KA2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the DoralLock Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 Security</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for both standard 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>5 pin cylinder locks (Kwikset Compatible Keyway).</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Fit standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Full 1\" bolt throw.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li><b>3 Year Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>1 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-7312KA2-specifications.pdf?v=1704262177\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock Double Cylinder Deadbolt Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 2 Double Cylinder Deadbolt, DoralLock 7312KA2",
                "description": "DoralLock 7312KA2, Double Cylinder Grade 2 Deadbolt - Made by DoralLock, the 7312KA2 double cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security lock. The double cylinder function means that there is a  keyed lock on both the exterior and the interior. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches.  It installs easily in most pre-drilled doors.",
